Minecraft core shaders (shaders/overlays/)

  Every program under shaders/overlays/*/core/ that carries a vanilla name --
  entity.vsh, sky.vsh, text.fsh, item.vsh, glint.vsh, position_tex.fsh, the
  rendertype_* family, and their .json pipeline definitions -- is Minecraft's
  own core shader, copied from the game client and modified: shadr's vertex
  re-projection hook and its SDF fragment path are spliced into the vanilla
  source, and the surrounding code is Mojang's, unchanged.

